, I live my life with pride."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "You can\u2019t please everyone, that\u2019s for sure,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "But I stay true and I pave my own course."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Cause if you own it too, it\u2019s no longer out of taste,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "So dare, step up, and live life with grace."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}